{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Irynx picks Willow up and pulls her into an embrace. \"Yesterday, I wanted to tell you that I love you. Not in the way you think love should mean, but still love.\"\n\nShe puts Willow down, and then sits on the ground to meet her at eye level. \"You've been through a lot of me, seen the *much*ness that I am, and you haven't turned away. And I am so grateful for that, Willow.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:18:34.345000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870082839713030194","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Why would I turn away from you? You're super cool! And nice! And fun! I'm grateful for you too!\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:21:48.364000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870083653487706145","reply_to_id":"870082839713030194","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
