{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"She tilts her head at the Mender. \"What's wrong?\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:28:43.883000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870085396300718120","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Giving up on friends.... on your family.... giving into fear.... being removed from the world..... no one listens to the one that already lived that tale\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:29:37.777000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870085622348541972","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"he shrugs \"what is done is done.... but just as I took the cowards way out....\" he trails off","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:30:18.564000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870085793421623306","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"time to focus on what is.... rather than what was\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:30:57.244000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870085955657297970","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Irynx sighs. \"If you want my thoughts, I think what she's doing is selfish... not that I would say that to her face.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:31:44.247000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870086152802168905","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"he nods \"I need some info about the ravens....\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:33:56.412000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870086707142357002","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"he looks at Irynx waiting","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:34:51.133000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870086936658837565","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I can tell you what I know.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:35:10.531000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870087018019946527","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I don't know if there is a price to pay for asking you\" he states carefully","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:35:45.704000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870087165546217513","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"To my knowledge, there isn't.\" She chirps. \"The green man said I'd have none of the ravens' power, either to undo death or answer questions like they do, so as far as I'm concerned this is just a talk between friends. And I'd never charge for a conversation!\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:40:53.162000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870088455118549042","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"he smiles \"good.... what I need are facts.... Is a person allowed to talk to the ravens without making requests?\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:42:10.559000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-28T23:42:30.716000Z","id":"870088779745095741","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"bones will return later in the meantime heads to <#850786156479119391>","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:44:34.827000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870089384848928848","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I don't know anyone who's tried. A conversation with beings as powerful as the ravens, most often it comes with requests.\"\n\nShe places a clawed hand beneath her chin, pondering. \"Thinking about it, asking for a conversation is a request already.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:44:58.922000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870089485910691860","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"but that would mean 4 requests rather than 3?\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:45:39.013000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870089654064517120","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"She smiles, though it's more with her eyes now. \"They'd be locked to three.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:47:38.309000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870090154428235786","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I keep thinking about it.... their conversations with the dead are a little more loose.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:47:57.505000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870090234942070804","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"regardless.... do they care about the people of kingsbridge?\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:48:07.491000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870090276826382416","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"She nods immediately. \"Enough to sacrifice themselves.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:48:25.931000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870090354169372672","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"he thinks \"does the importance of a memory or thought determine anything about what you get from your requests?\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:49:34.938000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870090643605692416","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"A thought, a memory, or a life. Those are the prices with them. Usually, the bill comes after the meal, so to speak.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:54:01.653000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870091762289479681","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"are you allowed to tell them what price you are willing to pay, so as to not be overcharged?\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:54:38.646000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870091917449392128","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I believe there'd be room for negotiation. A price taken isn't really the same as a price given. When we went here before, Willow chose the memory she wanted to pay.\" She turns her head to see if anyone would listen. \"A horrible memory of what she'd done. She's better off without it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:56:53.412000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870092482698936351","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"he nods \"Lastly.... do you just approach the tree to speak to them?\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:57:36.100000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870092661745397791","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"You call to them, usually. The legends say they fly all over the world collecting information. I'd love to do that myself one day. But if you stand in the grove and call to them, they'll settle there on the branches,\" she points up to the willow, \"and they'll listen.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T00:01:01.692000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870093524060745828","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
