{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Muninn lands on the menders shoulder. \"Yes mender?\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T00:20:34.850000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870098444642037830","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"he looks at Muninn \"I have been told that you care for the people of Kingsbridge greatly, to a point you sacrificed yourself for them.  I also recognize this is your place.  You know why I was brought back.  I want to bring stability.... to fix that which is broken.  But I need to find the right words.  I am willing to give up the love I have for two of my first friends, Amara and Navar if I must..... But I want you to at least have the option of what words would best take care of stabilizing Kingsbridge.  If you do not wish to give me those words, or find that price too little.... I will try to find ones you would approve of.... But I first wanted to defer to your wisdom for your people.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T00:25:04.884000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870099577246715944","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Willow tilts her head.","created_at":"2021-07-29T00:28:24.605000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870100414937305089","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"It hurts to lose a memory you love,\" Irynx stands, holds her hands in front of her, as she looks at the Mender. \"Why not a memory that brings you pain?\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T00:28:29.137000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870100433945919488","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"You cannot give back the seed you have planted and watered mender. You have already planted memories that will one day walk and talk. You offer much and little in the same breath.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T00:28:37.959000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870100470948057159","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"The memories will live.... I offer you the thoughts of love I had for them.  I didn't want the pick to ever feel that absence from me.  It deserves its own life... a good one.  I don't want to forget them... not the friendship.... but I loved both of them.... they were the first non chinn to take me in.... and my mission is important enough to lose that feeling they give me if need be.  There is little I value more, and oaths to the one that owns that love mean I cannot give that.  But if your decision is that isn't enough.... then I will find the words.... I wanted you to have the chance to set them.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T00:33:55.535000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870101802958356540","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Willow takes out a quarter-filled jar of cold soup and sips it.","created_at":"2021-07-29T00:36:41.909000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870102500781482004","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"You are as bad as the rest of the citizens of empire.\" He chuckles. \" what are \"thoughts you had.\" If not memories. It is not that it isn't enough mender. It is that you offer the price in the same breath as the question. In our grove, you ask questions, and then you offer. We reserve the right to negotiate the price after the asking. Not before. No one ought to pay for a thing with out understanding it first.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T00:39:22.664000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870103175036801075","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Ask a question mender. Be wise.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T00:40:18.588000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870103409599062017","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Irynx blinks at the Mender. She did tell him, after all.","created_at":"2021-07-29T00:42:01.782000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870103842426060880","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"he nods \"There are prices I cannot pay.... So I cannot ask you and you require those prices...\" he pauses \"Muninn.... what would you have me write on the stone I will set in Kingsbridge, to put it on its best path, and give it what it needs most?\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T00:42:33.140000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870103973951045663","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Thoughts and memories are both food and poison. The difference between whether they sustain or defeat you is in Veracity and Self Discipline. \"Is it true?\" and \"can I endure the truth of it? \"\nThoughts can be intelligence or base cunning. Memories can be wisdom or a prison. \n\nLet Veracity lead to Wisdom and Wisdom back to truth. Let us not be divided on the surety of either. Let your thoughts and memories cause others to rise as you rise.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T00:51:10.948000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-29T00:54:25.360000Z","id":"870106145795219466","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Once your have asked. Once I have answered.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T00:51:40.871000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870106271301402664","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"the mender sits and thinks for a bit","created_at":"2021-07-29T00:53:47.624000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870106802942001163","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Muninn, As this is your domain, You would know better than I.... Where would you have me set the Kingsbridge stone so that it may endure the ravages or time, and keep the heart of this town beating?\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T00:57:21.766000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870107701118664745","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"The heart of any town is the cup from which it drinks. Cleanse the umbral cup and set the stone there that the people might once again begin to see kingsbridge as a home rather than just the last outpost before the Noir.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T00:59:30.685000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-29T01:00:41.121000Z","id":"870108241844138016","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Twice you have asked. Twice we have answered. Once more if you will.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T01:00:08.202000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870108399201833041","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"The mender pauses once again to think things through","created_at":"2021-07-29T01:01:09.662000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870108656983765102","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Muninn..... what advice would you most like to give the people of this city beyond the words you gave me for my first two requests?\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T01:05:38.953000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870109786472063006","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
