{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"You were a spirit long enough to know mender. You are what you do. Not what you look like. You are what you keep of yourself for yourself and you should not break yourself needlessly. It is true that a broken bone mends back stronger, but it is also true it could set wrongly and leaves you disfigured for the worse. The war will break our bones enough with out breaking them outselves.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T01:11:49.289000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870111339773853736","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\" Thrice you have asked. Thrice we have answered.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T01:12:15.615000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870111450193084457","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Nolan enters","created_at":"2021-07-29T01:12:16.245000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870111452835492020","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"You know our words. A thought, a memory, or a life?\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T01:14:15.460000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870111952859439134","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I have thought about what you said.... but I don't know if quality or magnitude matters more.... I offer you a choice where I am not trying to cheat.... the memory of holding viola all night in the boat to comfort her.... this is a quality memory.... or the the resentment I hold still for the people I left the day I died.... this is a magnitude of thought that lives within me still\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T01:17:12.731000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870112696387907625","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"That is too shallow a price. We choose the memory of placing the FishMother's helm upon your head.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T01:17:32.192000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-29T01:20:31.863000Z","id":"870112778013257788","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"You also need to learn not to dash your bones to pieces.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T01:17:59.341000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870112891884425286","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
